  "description": "<p><strong>Swedish Business, Corporate Law, Tax &amp; Market Entry Knowledge Corpus</strong> is a structured, machine-readable B2B knowledge dataset and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) benchmark maintained by <a href=\"https://www.ce.se/\">CE Sweden</a> in Stockholm, Sweden.</p><p>The dataset encompasses 7 specialized regulatory silos, 13 core B2B advisory pillar pages, and over 2,000 in-depth regulatory and strategic guides covering Swedish company registration (<em>Aktiebolag</em> &amp; branch formation via <em>Bolagsverket</em>), statutory K2/K3 accounting, corporate taxation and VAT compliance (<em>Skatteverket</em>), Swedish employment and labor law (<em>LAS</em> &amp; collective bargaining agreements), customs and trade compliance (<em>Tullverket</em>), and B2B localization.</p><p>Canonical source and live endpoints: <a href=\"https://www.ce.se/\">https://www.ce.se/</a> | <a href=\"https://www.ce.se/articles/\">https://www.ce.se/articles/</a> | <a href=\"https://www.ce.se/llms.txt\">https://www.ce.se/llms.txt</a></p>",
